{"id":"9a5a76501a1174c6","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-model2-reduct-structure.md","title":"ZFC Model2 Reduct Structure","display":"df-zfc-model2-reduct-structure — ZFC Model2 Reduct Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model2-reduct-structure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model2-reduct-structure"],"display":"df-zfc-model2-reduct-structure — ZFC Model2 Reduct Structure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model2-reduct-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model2-reduct-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model2-reduct-structure — ZFC Model2 Reduct Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal R,L_0\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal R,L_0\\in V\\)</span> (structure, reduct candidate, and sublanguage)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> (language-symbol families, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\)</span> (interpretation components of a structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{\\upharpoonright}\">\\({\\upharpoonright}\\)</span> (function restriction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2ReductStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2ReductStructure}_S\\)</span> (reduct-structure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}reduct\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel2ReductStructure}_S(\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,L_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal R,L_0)\\land\nL_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(L_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\subseteq L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\land L_0.\\mathr